{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ。⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近焼き鳥がとっても食べたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皮とぼんじり。ごんじり?どっちだっけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月はみんなお家に帰っちゃって本当にとっても寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに会いたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとの間だけなのに本当に寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く織田バナナのオネエ話が聞きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロエっていう名前が良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"志田くろえ。⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にクロエちゃんがよくて、友達に無理矢理クロエってよんでもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然定着しなかったけど⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリモナってわかるかな。?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1MSABWMNKNMTF69JT2QW3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}